+---
+name: finance-active-customer
+description: what "active customer" means in the finance reporting views (developer statement)
+type: context
+scope: finance reporting views, Views/rpt.vwFinance*.sql and new finance views
+status: verified
+last-verified: 2026-03-02
+---
+In the finance reporting views, a customer counts as active in a month when it has at least one `fact.FactSales` order in the 3 months ending with that month, the month included. `rpt.vwFinanceExtract` applies the same 3-month filter to its order dates.
+**Confidence:** observed
+**Provenance:** developer statement, 2026-03-02, rechecked against `Views/rpt.vwFinanceExtract.sql` the same day
+**Evidence:** `Views/rpt.vwFinanceExtract.sql`, its order-date filter
+**Counterevidence / exceptions:** applies to the finance reporting views only
+**Dependencies / unresolved:** none
+**Verify by:** read the order-date filter in `Views/rpt.vwFinanceExtract.sql`
+**Semantic refresh:** trigger: a change to `Views/rpt.vwFinanceExtract.sql`; result: rechecked 2026-03-02, the filter was present
+**Draft status:** draft pending PR review; not team-approved policy
